<!--
    Hyperion override of Magento_LayeredNavigation's 1column page layout.

    The vendor file at
    `vendor/magento/module-layered-navigation/view/frontend/page_layout/1column.xml`
    contains a single move:

        <move element="catalog.leftnav" destination="content.top" after="-"/>

    `content.top` renders the block at the very top of the `main` column -
    which produces a vertical stack of filter cards ABOVE the
    `hyperion.category.view` wrapper (i.e. above the category H1 and
    breadcrumbs inside the wrapper). For Hyperion the 1column design
    shows filters as a horizontal chip bar BELOW the H1, inside our
    wrapper - see `category/view.phtml`'s `$leftnav->toHtml()` inside
    `[data-hyperion-inline-filters]`.

    This override replaces the vendor move with a move to
    `hyperion.category.view`. The wrapper is a plain `Template` block
    (no auto-render of children), so the only path that reaches the
    DOM is our explicit inline call - exactly one filter bar on the
    1column category page.

    On 2col / 3col / default layouts the vendor's `2columns-left.xml`,
    `2columns-right.xml`, `3columns.xml` page_layout files still run
    and move `catalog.leftnav` into `sidebar.main` - so sidebars on
    those layouts remain fully functional.

    The additional sidebar wrapper (wishlist, compare, widgets; a
    full-width row of cards on 1column, see Magento_Theme/page_layout/
    1column.xml) goes into `hyperion.sidebar.inline`, an untagged container
    that exists on every page; the category handle moves that container
    into the category view, where `category/view.phtml` prints it right
    under the inline filter bar, above the product grid. It must NOT be
    moved into `hyperion.category.view` from here: a move whose destination
    is missing (home page, customer pages) detaches the element, which is
    then printed after the page wrapper, under the footer.
-->
<layout xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
        xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="urn:magento:framework:View/Layout/etc/page_layout.xsd">
    <move element="catalog.leftnav" destination="hyperion.category.view" after="-"/>
    <move element="div.sidebar.additional" destination="hyperion.sidebar.inline" after="-"/>
</layout>
